{
  "id": "1100",
  "title": "Is the Weather Good?",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2020-11-07",
  "synopsis": "Plans to go out are often dependent on the weather. So is the weather good tomorrow?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/1100/19be6040dbb9d24df029c35daa20f77c10952fae.mp3?1596885259",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "天气好吗？\n\n妻子：如果明天天气好，你和我一起去商店买新衣服吧！你看看天气预报怎么说？\n丈夫：明天下雨、下雪、打雷，好像还有台风！",
    "traditional": "天氣好嗎？\n\n妻子：如果明天天氣好，你和我一起去商店買新衣服吧！你看看天氣預報怎麼說？\n丈夫：明天下雨、下雪、打雷，好像還有颱風！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Is the Weather Good?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "妻子：如果明天天气好，你和我一起去商店买新衣服吧！",
      "traditional": "妻子：如果明天天氣好，你和我一起去商店買新衣服吧！",
      "pinyin": "qī zi rú guǒ míng tiān tiān qì hǎo nǐ hé wǒ yì qǐ qù shāng diàn mǎi xīn yī fu ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "你看看天气预报怎么说？",
      "traditional": "你看看天氣預報怎麼說？",
      "pinyin": "nǐ kàn kan tiān qì yù bào zěn me shuō",
      "english": "Wife: If the weather is good tomorrow, let’s go to the shops together to buy new clothes!"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Can you check what the weather forecast says?"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "丈夫：明天下雨、下雪、打雷，好像还有台风！",
      "traditional": "丈夫：明天下雨、下雪、打雷，好像還有颱風！",
      "pinyin": "zhàng fu míng tiān xià yǔ xià xuě dǎ léi hǎo xiàng hái yǒu tái fēng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Husband: Tomorrow it is raining, snowing, thundering, and it also seems like there will be a typhoon!"
    }
  ],
